<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65734" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειονεκτ-έω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>have too little, to be
			poor</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺν τῷ γενναίῳ μ.</span>,
			opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺν τῷ ἀδίκῳ πλέον
			ἔχειν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Ages.</u>
				4.5
			</span></i>; <i>come short</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. εἰ
			μή</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.6.23
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.14.6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἔν τινι</span>
			<i>fall short</i> in a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Hier.</u>
				1.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				27
			</span></i>: c. gen. rei, <i>to be short of</i> a thing, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίτων καὶ ποτῶν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τῶν εὐφροσυνῶν ἔν
			τινι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.29
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν δικαίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					6.71
				</span></i>
			: c. gen. pers. et dat. rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ εὐφροσύνῃ μ. τῶν ἰδιωτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Hier.</u>
					1.18
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλεονεκτέω</span>, Hierax ap.<i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				3.9.54
			</span></i>.</div>
